{"baseRefName":"main","body":"Closes #18\n\n## What changed\n\n- Packages the production TanStack Start output, committed migrations, and standalone migration tooling in one non-root stateless OCI image.\n- Runs migrations before serving, fails closed for missing/unreachable `DATABASE_URL`, and adds database-aware `GET /health`.\n- Adds Docker/PostgreSQL/Playwright black-box smoke coverage for migration, startup refusal, health, connectivity loss, and the assembled Capture → Plan journey.\n- Adds public GHCR publication for `latest`, SHA, and release tags, plus self-hosted deployment, rollback, gateway, provisioning, backup, and tested-restore guidance.\n\n## Why\n\nThe assembled private app needs a repeatable, operator-owned deployment contract while keeping PostgreSQL, TLS, access control, routing, backups, and recovery ownership outside the application.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `bun run lint`\n- `bun run typecheck`\n- `bun run test` (66 tests locally; PostgreSQL integration coverage runs in CI)\n- `bun run build`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Direct built-app health check with an unreachable database returned `503 {\"status\":\"unavailable\"}`.\n\nLocal Docker is unavailable in this workspace. The new GitHub Actions `Container smoke` job builds the image and runs the full disposable-PostgreSQL black-box suite.\n","commits":[{"authoredDate":"2026-08-11T16:50:01Z","authors":[{"email":"me@christse.dev","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDQ1MA==","login":"chris-tse","name":"Chris Tse"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-11T16:50:01Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"feat: containerize self-hosted app","oid":"e5049d403b146fd11a49b223c4feea45f1d7437f"},{"authoredDate":"2026-08-11T17:01:41Z","authors":[{"email":"me@christse.dev","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDQ1MA==","login":"chris-tse","name":"Chris Tse"}],"committedDate":"2026-08-11T17:01:41Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"fix: harden self-hosted migration startup","oid":"8281cac2c5714a7d291d9b6234773529e67af10c"},{"authoredDate":"2026-08-11T17:04:10Z"